      <desc>This cancer Mortality Analysis Dashboard explores cancer survival patterns by age, gender, cancer type, and state.It visualizes the distribution of deceased VS survived patients, identifies high-risk age groups and cancer-types, and highlight regional mortality differences to dsupport better healthcare insights.</desc>
